    "notes": [
      "Draft configuration: Historical ProDrive Fen End triangular northern course from the independent 2013-01-01 OSM snapshot (leisure=track way 91889043 version 2), including the southern chicane. The complete closed source way is retained; the separate southern handling loop 91890529 is excluded. This predates the 2015-2017 JLR realignment confirmed by the circuit designer. The supplied layout identity and 2324 m nominal length refer to the older northern configuration, not the 4085 m rebuilt current candidate. No modern connector, raster coordinates or privately supplied course coordinates are used. Branch identity was checked against catalogue layout facts and circuit identification references. Independent source distance 2329.2 m; no coordinates are changed to match a diagram or distance. Travel direction and historical alignment remain provisional."
